WEBVTT

00:00:35.660 --> 00:00:36.910
Give him!

00:00:38.500 --> 00:00:40.040
Double team to the back-up!

00:00:47.120 --> 00:00:50.290
World in the picture represents the past.

00:00:50.290 --> 00:00:53.040
Anything you have changed
may warp the space and time,

00:00:53.040 --> 00:00:54.410
and rewrite the future.

00:00:54.410 --> 00:00:55.750
But there's an exception.

00:00:55.750 --> 00:00:57.290
What exception?

00:00:57.290 --> 00:01:00.540
At some point in time,
there is an important node.

00:01:00.540 --> 00:01:03.450
Even if you accidentally
alter all the previous course,

00:01:03.450 --> 00:01:07.040
but if there's no change about the result
of what happened at the time frame.

00:01:07.040 --> 00:01:08.660
Then

00:01:08.660 --> 00:01:10.910
nothing will be changed.

00:01:24.160 --> 00:01:27.410
It was the most
unforgettable day in my life.

00:01:27.410 --> 00:01:29.080
I lost the game,

00:01:29.080 --> 00:01:30.870
missed my first love,

00:01:30.870 --> 00:01:33.500
and had a big fight with my mom.

00:01:33.500 --> 00:01:36.410
Once the important event node is changed,

00:01:36.410 --> 00:01:39.910
then all the past after that
may be rewritten.

00:02:55.790 --> 00:02:57.620
--Score!
--We made it!

00:02:57.620 --> 00:03:00.410
I didn't expect it was you who finally
resisted the pressure to finish the final!

00:03:00.410 --> 00:03:01.330
You're fucking awesome!

00:03:01.330 --> 00:03:03.410
How did you make the defence?

00:03:03.410 --> 00:03:06.330
You just lost to a new formed
township school basketball team!

00:03:07.290 --> 00:03:11.500
Where did this damn back-up come from?

00:03:11.500 --> 00:03:13.330
Well done, Chen Xiao!

00:03:13.330 --> 00:03:15.120
That final goal is such a good pass!

00:03:16.500 --> 00:03:18.000
Eh? Chen Xiao,

00:03:18.000 --> 00:03:19.500
Why are you standing there?

00:03:19.500 --> 00:03:21.410
Overwhelmed, huh?

00:03:24.500 --> 00:03:26.000
As the reporter of the school newspaper,

00:03:26.000 --> 00:03:27.830
it's okay to take photos right?

00:03:27.830 --> 00:03:28.540
Oh damn!

00:03:28.540 --> 00:03:30.620
Chen Xiao! No flashes!

00:03:34.120 --> 00:03:35.330
Dribble charging from Long Yang!

00:03:35.330 --> 00:03:36.250
Lu Guang,

00:03:36.250 --> 00:03:39.160
did I just affect the historical track?

00:03:45.330 --> 00:03:48.080
Once the important
event node is changed...

00:03:49.410 --> 00:03:51.870
Don't stand there, newcomer.

00:03:51.870 --> 00:03:54.080
We lack one person here.
Would you like to join us?

00:03:59.330 --> 00:04:03.120
...then all the past after that
may be rewritten.

00:04:04.580 --> 00:04:06.410
Lu Guang! Lu Guang!

00:04:06.410 --> 00:04:07.660
You still there?

00:04:10.700 --> 00:04:12.000
What's wrong with him?

00:04:12.000 --> 00:04:14.370
He is dumbfounded after the game.

00:04:14.370 --> 00:04:16.620
Is he so excited that
he has cerebral thrombosis?

00:04:16.620 --> 00:04:18.540
--Chen Xiao.
--Get off me!

00:04:21.580 --> 00:04:23.500
Captain,

00:04:23.500 --> 00:04:25.040
I'm sorry,

00:04:25.040 --> 00:04:26.660
just leave me alone, please.

00:04:28.790 --> 00:04:30.790
Lu Guang! Where are you?

00:04:30.790 --> 00:04:32.450
Say something!

00:04:40.870 --> 00:04:42.040
Stop it!

00:04:43.700 --> 00:04:44.950
You asshole!

00:04:44.950 --> 00:04:46.330
Where have you been?

00:04:46.330 --> 00:04:48.700
I almost quit the photo!

00:04:48.700 --> 00:04:51.120
The client's words were
all written on the note.

00:04:51.120 --> 00:04:53.040
I didn't know where Qiao Ling placed it.

00:04:54.250 --> 00:04:55.580
Now I found it.

00:04:55.580 --> 00:04:57.500
Look at you all anxious.

00:04:57.500 --> 00:04:59.870
Now you finally know
the consequences of nonsense, right?

00:04:59.870 --> 00:05:02.370
Damned! You were deliberately tricking me!

00:05:02.370 --> 00:05:04.750
I'm not you.

00:05:04.750 --> 00:05:07.500
The node of last event has indeed
been rewritten by you,

00:05:07.500 --> 00:05:10.290
but the final result is not changed.

00:05:11.370 --> 00:05:12.290
Why?

00:05:12.290 --> 00:05:13.950
Hey, Chen Xiao,

00:05:13.950 --> 00:05:17.000
you won the game,
but left the camera?

00:05:21.910 --> 00:05:23.620
I was too excited to remember that.

00:05:23.620 --> 00:05:27.540
Oh, are we going to play
with other teams after this?

00:05:27.540 --> 00:05:30.750
Does this mean the basketball hall
can also be preserved in this way?

00:05:32.660 --> 00:05:35.500
In fact, whether you win or not today,

00:05:35.500 --> 00:05:40.330
the leaders have decided
to tear it down and rebuild.

00:05:40.330 --> 00:05:41.750
In the end,

00:05:41.750 --> 00:05:43.080
--studying is more
important than interest.

00:05:43.080 --> 00:05:45.330
--Cap, cap.
--studying is more
important than interest.

00:05:45.330 --> 00:05:47.620
Are we going to play
in the county next time?

00:05:47.620 --> 00:05:48.870
--Yes, absolutely right.
--A few more winning,

00:05:48.870 --> 00:05:51.580
our school will certainly support us
in running the school team!

00:05:51.580 --> 00:05:52.250
Yeah!

00:05:52.250 --> 00:05:54.540
Maybe they can help us
repair the stadium.

00:05:54.540 --> 00:05:56.500
Wood floors and headlights.

00:05:56.500 --> 00:05:58.120
Wow! That's perfect!

00:05:58.120 --> 00:05:59.540
Wonderful!

00:06:00.500 --> 00:06:02.870
Maybe I should tell them the truth.

00:06:02.870 --> 00:06:05.290
They have to know sooner or later.

00:06:15.790 --> 00:06:17.330
Thank you so much, Coach.

00:06:17.330 --> 00:06:20.000
Told you to call me teacher, teacher.

00:06:20.000 --> 00:06:22.160
What's the matter with you today?

00:06:24.410 --> 00:06:25.830
--The basketball hall is safe now.
--Yeah.

00:06:25.830 --> 00:06:27.000
--You guys are amazing!
--Yes.

00:06:27.000 --> 00:06:29.660
--That was awesome!
--Unbelievable pass!

00:06:33.450 --> 00:06:36.290
Cheng Xiaoshi, don't forget your mission.

00:06:36.290 --> 00:06:37.700
Save your strength.

00:06:38.660 --> 00:06:39.910
Just leaving a message,

00:06:39.910 --> 00:06:41.790
how hard can it be?

00:06:41.790 --> 00:06:44.200
But before that, you have to...

00:06:45.370 --> 00:06:47.700
...send Lu Hongbin back home.

00:06:49.750 --> 00:06:51.620
I left my legs in the hall.

00:06:51.620 --> 00:06:53.750
I'm losing my life on this thing.

00:06:53.750 --> 00:06:56.540
Why is it always me?

00:06:58.410 --> 00:07:00.830
Chen Xiao, put me down if you are tired.

00:07:00.830 --> 00:07:02.950
I can walk by myself.

00:07:02.950 --> 00:07:06.000
Don't worry, I got this.

00:07:08.950 --> 00:07:11.910
You look energetic.

00:07:11.910 --> 00:07:12.910
That's good.

00:07:12.910 --> 00:07:15.290
Take the client's words to him now.

00:07:16.750 --> 00:07:18.040
Lu Guang,

00:07:18.040 --> 00:07:20.500
I owe you in my last life!

00:07:23.410 --> 00:07:24.660
By the way,

00:07:24.660 --> 00:07:26.410
you are so good at basketball,

00:07:26.410 --> 00:07:27.950
why didn't you show your hands earlier?

00:07:27.950 --> 00:07:32.040
I was worried for a long time
for making you the back-up.

00:07:32.040 --> 00:07:33.910
Cap,

00:07:33.910 --> 00:07:35.620
I have something to tell you...

00:08:06.870 --> 00:08:08.250
Lu Hongbin!

00:08:10.450 --> 00:08:11.330
Lu Hongbin!

00:08:11.330 --> 00:08:13.040
You sneaked off to play basketball again?

00:08:13.040 --> 00:08:14.870
You don't want to go
to the college anymore?

00:08:14.870 --> 00:08:16.950
Oh my god, what's wrong with your leg?

00:08:16.950 --> 00:08:18.000
Can't it be broken?

00:08:18.000 --> 00:08:18.910
Pooh! pooh! pooh!

00:08:18.910 --> 00:08:21.160
How can you curse on
your elder brother like this?

00:08:21.160 --> 00:08:23.290
It's not profitable or knowledgeable
to play basketball.

00:08:23.290 --> 00:08:25.370
Is it worth it?!

00:08:25.370 --> 00:08:27.410
She is the client's first love,

00:08:27.410 --> 00:08:29.830
and also the goal of our second mission.

00:08:29.830 --> 00:08:30.790
Without you saying,

00:08:30.790 --> 00:08:33.450
I have felt that
through his body reaction.

00:08:37.040 --> 00:08:39.250
You are the guy playing with my brother?

00:08:39.250 --> 00:08:40.620
Who are you?

00:08:40.620 --> 00:08:42.370
I haven't seen you before.

00:08:43.870 --> 00:08:45.120
Chen Xiao?

00:08:45.120 --> 00:08:46.620
Hey, where are your glasses?

00:08:46.620 --> 00:08:48.580
I really didn't recognize you
without your glasses.

00:08:48.580 --> 00:08:52.580
Oh, it was tramp down when playing.

00:08:52.580 --> 00:08:53.910
My god!

00:08:53.910 --> 00:08:56.620
Were you playing or fighting today?

00:08:56.620 --> 00:08:57.870
One walked with a limp, one is blind.

00:08:57.870 --> 00:08:59.040
You guys are crazy!

00:08:59.040 --> 00:09:01.000
Okay, that's enough, my sister.

00:09:01.000 --> 00:09:02.330
Could you stop here?

00:09:02.330 --> 00:09:04.290
You are just like our mom.

00:09:04.290 --> 00:09:05.200
Hey, Chen Xiao,

00:09:05.200 --> 00:09:07.370
take us a photo for memory.

00:09:07.370 --> 00:09:08.580
For memories?

00:09:08.580 --> 00:09:10.500
For what to memorize today?

00:09:10.500 --> 00:09:11.830
I'm so happy today.

00:09:11.830 --> 00:09:14.700
A happy day is worth remembering!

00:09:16.040 --> 00:09:18.370
Meng Meng, have you read
so much books that

00:09:18.370 --> 00:09:19.660
you are losing your expression?

00:09:19.660 --> 00:09:20.790
Can you smile a little bit?

00:09:20.790 --> 00:09:23.080
--Eh?
--Liu Meng, just a little smile, okay?

00:09:23.910 --> 00:09:25.370
Three,

00:09:25.370 --> 00:09:26.410
two,

00:09:26.410 --> 00:09:27.450
one.

00:09:27.450 --> 00:09:29.160
Lames!

00:09:36.830 --> 00:09:38.870
Here you go.
You two should take one, too.

00:09:40.200 --> 00:09:41.330
For what?

00:09:41.330 --> 00:09:43.330
To my most surprised day.

00:09:43.330 --> 00:09:44.750
He's really good at
dunking and three points!

00:09:44.750 --> 00:09:48.120
What? You can dunk?

00:09:50.330 --> 00:09:53.700
Don't mention that, I learned it
from cartoons on bilibili.

00:09:53.700 --> 00:09:55.000
Hey.

00:09:55.000 --> 00:09:58.040
Mind your words and deeds,
and keep your tail down.

00:09:58.040 --> 00:10:00.410
Don't play dumb, Come on.

00:10:00.410 --> 00:10:04.620
Oh no, get away, I can't do it.

00:10:04.620 --> 00:10:05.620
Cheng Xiaoshi!

00:10:05.620 --> 00:10:06.540
Come on!

00:10:06.540 --> 00:10:09.620
There's no time for wasting, hurry up!

00:10:11.450 --> 00:10:14.080
Hey, are you two
anode and cathode?

00:10:14.080 --> 00:10:15.700
Get closer.

00:10:22.500 --> 00:10:25.040
Cheng Xiaoshi, paw down.

00:10:25.040 --> 00:10:25.870
Three,

00:10:25.870 --> 00:10:26.750
two,

00:10:26.750 --> 00:10:27.500
one.

00:10:27.500 --> 00:10:29.660
Blinds!

00:10:39.620 --> 00:10:40.790
Home, finally!

00:10:40.790 --> 00:10:42.580
Chen Xiao, thank you so much today!

00:10:42.580 --> 00:10:45.620
You're welcome, easy cake, easy take.

00:10:45.620 --> 00:10:46.910
I'm leaving.

00:10:46.910 --> 00:10:48.290
Wait!

00:10:48.290 --> 00:10:51.080
Meng Meng, walk him out, will you?

00:10:53.250 --> 00:10:54.540
Oh.

00:11:01.870 --> 00:11:03.080
Lu Guang,

00:11:03.080 --> 00:11:05.370
Liu Meng puts everything on her face,

00:11:05.370 --> 00:11:07.950
how could he miss that?

00:11:07.950 --> 00:11:09.540
Let the past be.

00:11:09.540 --> 00:11:14.040
We just need to deliver
the words. Nothing else.

00:11:14.040 --> 00:11:16.830
Oh, my heart is almost out of my throat.

00:11:16.830 --> 00:11:19.580
Apparently, he really wanted to say it.

00:11:19.580 --> 00:11:21.830
So, did he or not?

00:11:21.830 --> 00:11:23.500
Chen Xiao,

00:11:23.500 --> 00:11:24.790
so,

00:11:24.790 --> 00:11:28.830
you really look nicer
without your glasses.

00:11:29.790 --> 00:11:31.830
She makes her steps first,

00:11:31.830 --> 00:11:33.910
what should I do?

00:11:37.700 --> 00:11:39.080
Well,

00:11:39.080 --> 00:11:41.160
Chen Xiao,

00:11:41.160 --> 00:11:43.370
do you know about my family?

00:11:45.120 --> 00:11:46.290
Yeah,

00:11:46.290 --> 00:11:48.040
a little from your brother.

00:11:53.080 --> 00:11:55.830
He's my half-brother,

00:11:55.830 --> 00:12:01.120
so my father wants me to stay with him
after the high school entrance exam,

00:12:01.120 --> 00:12:03.750
to study in the city.

00:12:03.750 --> 00:12:05.290
But I...

00:12:06.410 --> 00:12:09.000
What should I say, Lu Guang?

00:12:43.410 --> 00:12:45.040
Okay! Pinkie promise!

00:12:52.040 --> 00:12:53.410
Pinkie promise!

00:13:08.500 --> 00:13:11.950
Lu Guang, is that really okay to say so?

00:13:11.950 --> 00:13:15.200
Will they eventually miss each other?

00:13:16.200 --> 00:13:17.540
Yeah.

00:13:17.540 --> 00:13:19.200
The result will not change

00:13:19.200 --> 00:13:21.290
as long as the node does not change.

00:13:26.950 --> 00:13:28.450
All right,

00:13:28.450 --> 00:13:30.200
you're always right.

00:13:34.790 --> 00:13:36.330
What are you thinking?!

00:13:36.330 --> 00:13:38.080
Basketball, basketball.

00:13:38.080 --> 00:13:39.500
Where are your glasses?

00:13:39.500 --> 00:13:41.000
And what about your study?

00:13:41.000 --> 00:13:42.160
I'm sorry.

00:13:42.160 --> 00:13:43.120
It's all my fault, okay?

00:13:43.120 --> 00:13:46.290
You are fiddling around
and underachieving.

00:13:46.290 --> 00:13:48.870
You will be like your father
in the future!

00:13:48.870 --> 00:13:50.410
Why are you standing there?

00:13:52.120 --> 00:13:53.830
To the kitchen!

00:13:59.000 --> 00:14:04.620
It's so wasteful to cook
such a big meal for two people.

00:14:04.620 --> 00:14:06.910
Who knows when your father will be back.

00:14:06.910 --> 00:14:08.750
Never says anything in advance,

00:14:08.750 --> 00:14:12.410
and always blames me
if the food is not enough.

00:14:12.410 --> 00:14:15.250
It's not wasteful if you can eat more!

00:14:29.700 --> 00:14:30.910
Don't just eat.

00:14:30.910 --> 00:14:32.700
You still have a fight with her.

00:14:40.370 --> 00:14:41.910
What's the matter?

00:14:43.370 --> 00:14:46.000
Mom, I heard from Liu Meng that

00:14:46.000 --> 00:14:48.080
she will study in the city
in second half year.

00:14:48.080 --> 00:14:52.290
When can I go to the city, too?

00:14:59.910 --> 00:15:02.370
Here, the meat has been
disassembled for you,

00:15:02.370 --> 00:15:04.330
eat with the rice.

00:15:04.330 --> 00:15:09.450
I'm going to work in the city anyway,
why not get a job earlier? And...

00:15:09.450 --> 00:15:10.870
You go,

00:15:10.870 --> 00:15:12.450
right now if you want!

00:15:12.450 --> 00:15:14.910
You all just want to be
in the city anyway,

00:15:14.910 --> 00:15:16.950
leaving me alone at home.

00:15:16.950 --> 00:15:18.580
Never mind me!

00:15:18.580 --> 00:15:21.370
You father went to work
as a tabloid reporter in the city.

00:15:21.370 --> 00:15:25.910
I never know where he is,
or if he's still alive.

00:15:25.910 --> 00:15:29.580
Taking photos for others everyday
for so many years,

00:15:29.580 --> 00:15:32.870
but never one single
new photo for our family!

00:15:32.870 --> 00:15:36.450
I knew it, you're the same
with your father,

00:15:36.450 --> 00:15:38.540
underachieving and fiddling around!

00:15:38.540 --> 00:15:40.120
If you really want to go to the city,

00:15:40.120 --> 00:15:41.330
--I...
--you should be the Number One Scholar,

00:15:41.330 --> 00:15:42.790
study in a good school,

00:15:42.790 --> 00:15:44.660
and finally settle in the city,

00:15:44.660 --> 00:15:47.410
and take us all over with you!

00:15:47.410 --> 00:15:50.580
Lu Guang, I can't say anything
that might hurt her.

00:15:50.580 --> 00:15:52.200
Then finish the job as soon as possible.

00:15:52.200 --> 00:15:53.660
What?!

00:15:53.660 --> 00:15:56.080
Are you sure it's okay
if I just repeat after you?!

00:15:58.910 --> 00:16:00.290
Don't worry,

00:16:00.290 --> 00:16:02.080
the result will not change,

00:16:02.080 --> 00:16:04.330
even without any quarrel.

00:16:41.910 --> 00:16:44.040
It's abnormal!

00:16:44.040 --> 00:16:45.950
What's going on

00:16:45.950 --> 00:16:47.700
with this mission.

00:16:50.500 --> 00:16:51.410
All right.

00:16:51.410 --> 00:16:53.660
Let's just deliver all the messages,

00:16:53.660 --> 00:16:55.450
then the job's done.

00:16:56.700 --> 00:16:59.250
Can I fill myself before leaving?

00:16:59.250 --> 00:17:01.290
I'm overworked today.

00:17:06.290 --> 00:17:09.910
Ah, home-made is always the best.

00:17:09.910 --> 00:17:13.540
Just wait a second, I got noodles for you.

00:17:13.540 --> 00:17:16.410
Noodles again.

00:17:16.410 --> 00:17:18.660
I'm totally full, I can't eat anymore.

00:17:18.660 --> 00:17:22.040
Be good, you must eat this.

00:17:22.910 --> 00:17:25.000
I'm sorry, I really can't.

00:17:25.000 --> 00:17:25.830
I got to go.

00:17:25.830 --> 00:17:27.000
You forget that?

00:17:27.000 --> 00:17:28.870
Today is 12th of May,

00:17:28.870 --> 00:17:31.250
your father's birthday.

00:17:31.250 --> 00:17:35.370
We need to eat birthday noodles
even if he's not coming back.

00:17:36.370 --> 00:17:38.580
What year is this?

00:17:38.580 --> 00:17:41.080
What? Are you really eating too much?

00:17:41.080 --> 00:17:43.370
It's 2008, don't you know?

00:17:52.540 --> 00:17:53.950
I'm coming, coming.

00:17:53.950 --> 00:17:56.000
Who? It's so early!

00:18:00.910 --> 00:18:02.830
Qiao Ling!

00:18:02.830 --> 00:18:06.200
Chen Xiaoshi, what's going on?

00:18:07.290 --> 00:18:09.330
In the news, a lot of people died

00:18:09.330 --> 00:18:13.410
from the big earthquake last midnight!

00:18:13.410 --> 00:18:15.700
Would mom and dad be there?

00:18:15.700 --> 00:18:17.540
Would they be in the earthquake and

00:18:17.540 --> 00:18:20.200
they would never come back?

00:18:20.200 --> 00:18:22.160
Don't worry.

00:18:22.160 --> 00:18:24.950
They should have gone further

00:18:24.950 --> 00:18:26.910
and certainly will come back safely.

00:18:28.750 --> 00:18:30.620
Qiao Lin!

00:18:30.620 --> 00:18:32.700
I miss them!

00:18:36.040 --> 00:18:38.790
I miss them so much...

00:18:39.620 --> 00:18:42.540
Xiao Xiao, why are you
standing up while eating?

00:18:43.790 --> 00:18:45.000
Xiao Xiao?

00:18:46.660 --> 00:18:47.910
Xiao Xiao, are you okay?

00:18:47.910 --> 00:18:50.450
You don't feel well?

00:18:50.450 --> 00:18:52.370
Xiao Xiao, say something to me?

00:18:55.330 --> 00:18:57.580
Cheng Xiaoshi, out of the picture!

00:18:57.580 --> 00:19:00.040
