a little piece of the past!

00:19:58.120 --> 00:20:01.830
What's more, death is an important
node that can't be crossed.

00:20:01.830 --> 00:20:05.200
No matter how hard you try,
their destiny can't be turned round.

00:20:05.200 --> 00:20:06.250
--And it could even cause

00:20:06.250 --> 00:20:07.250
--Xiao Xiao,
--And it could even cause

00:20:07.250 --> 00:20:08.120
--what's the matter with you?
--And it could even cause

00:20:08.120 --> 00:20:10.080
--what's the matter with you?
--the disappearance of

00:20:10.080 --> 00:20:12.160
